  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6ab2f04f-ad13-4e26-8d4e-d057b9d31862.png\"></p>\n<p>Просто набор текстур, который меняет текстуры Better Archeology на стиль Bare Bones.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_42abc5f5-b9f4-4073-a08a-e88f51fdc821.png\"></p>\n<h1>⚠️<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">БЛАГОДАРНОСТИ</span></strong></h1>\n<p>Стиль текстур <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bare-bones</a></p>\n<p>Для мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-archeology\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Archeology - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></p>\n<p>Этот набор текстур создан для дополнения моего модпака&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minenhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minenhanced</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
